Usability standards
	One improvement per cycle; keep diffs under ~300 lines.
	Never push to main. Work on branch ux/<yyyy-mm-dd>-<slug>.
	Every UI change needs: clear labels, visible focus states, keyboard access,
helpful empty/error states, and loading feedback for actions over 300 ms.
	Run the test suite before declaring work done.
	Write handoffs to files: docs/ux-backlog.md, docs/plans/.
	This repo is DCIAC (Access). Do not edit dcim-hall-board.
